,["ARC or PLC in Cullman County","/arc-plc/alabama/cullman-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 193% of normal in May to June and just 39% in November to December. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 2007, with grid 16973 at 49% of normal. On grid 16973, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 65.0.</p>"}
